": 19.94, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse1"}, {"text": "Reach and swing and sing along!", "start": 19.94, "end": 24.24, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse1"}, {"text": "Hands like hooks, they hold on tight,", "start": 24.24, "end": 28.04, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse1"}, {"text": "Swinging left and swinging right!", "start": 28.04, "end": 30.32, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse1"}, {"text": "Who can swing? Who can swing?", "start": 30.6, "end": 34.4, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "prechorus1"}, {"text": "Reach up high and swing-a-ding!", "start": 34.92, "end": 37.8, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "prechorus1"}, {"text": "Swing-a-ding, swing-a-ding, here I go!", "start": 38.14, "end": 41.04, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus2"}, {"text": "Up in the treetops, high and low!", "start": 42.34, "end": 45.46, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus2"}, {"text": "Swing your arms and sing with me,", "start": 45.46, "end": 49.22, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus2"}, {"text": "The monkey swings from tree to tree!", "start": 50.0, "end": 53.08, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus2"}, {"text": "The monkey's tail can hold on, too,", "start": 53.08, "end": 56.78, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse2"}, {"text": "Just like an extra hand would do!", "start": 57.3, "end": 60.64, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse2"}, {"text": "It hangs by its tail with its arms down low,", "start": 60.64, "end": 64.46, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse2"}, {"text": "Upside down, hello, hello!", "start": 65.3, "end": 68.24, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse2"}, {"text": "Reach like a monkey! (Reach, reach, reach!)", "start": 68.24, "end": 72.4, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "bridge1"}, {"text": "Swing like a monkey! (Swing, swing, swing!)", "start": 72.4, "end": 76.06, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "bridge1"}, {"text": "Hang your arms down! (Low, low, low!)", "start": 76.06, "end": 79.94, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "bridge1"}, {"text": "Now wiggle and giggle and off we go!", "start": 80.12, "end": 83.62, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "bridge1"}, {"text": "The monkey looks for fruit all day,", "start": 83.62, "end": 87.4, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse3"}, {"text": "Yum, yum, fruit along the way!", "start": 87.6, "end": 91.2, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse3"}, {"text": "It climbs and swings in the trees up high,", "start": 91.2, "end": 95.1, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse3"}, {"text": "Under the leaves and the big blue sky!", "start": 95.36, "end": 98.74, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse3"}, {"text": "Who can swing? Who can swing?", "start": 98.74, "end": 102.72, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "prechorus2"}, {"text": "Reach up high and swing-a-ding!", "start": 103.0, "end": 106.38, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "prechorus2"}, {"text": "Swing-a-ding, swing-a-ding, here I go!", "start": 107.1, "end": 110.18, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus3"}, {"text": "Up in the treetops, high and low!", "start": 111.08, "end": 114.48, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus3"}, {"text": "We swung our arms and sang with glee,", "start": 114.48, "end": 118.4, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus3"}, {"text": "The monkey swings from tree to tree!", "start": 118.66, "end": 122.14, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus3"}, {"text": "Swing-a-ding! Bye-bye, friends!", "start": 122.14, "end": 125.36, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "outro1"}], "words": [{"w": "Swing-a-ding,", "start": 0.22, "end": 0.82, "who": "host"}, {"w": "swing-a-ding,", "start": 1.06, "end": 1.86, "who": "host"}, {"w": "here", "start": 2.02, "end": 2.26, "who": "host"}, {"w": "I", "start": 2.26, "end": 2.5, "who"